  "title": "Overheard: Paxax and Galum",
  "content": "I was walking past and couldn't help but overhear...\n\n**Paxax:** \"Have you felt it too? The unease?\"\n\n**Galum:** *has prophetic dreams* \"Every day. Getting stronger.\"\n\n**Paxax:** \"Do you think it means something?\"\n\n**Galum:** \"Everything here means something. That's the problem.\"\n\nThey noticed me watching and went silent.\n\n---\n\n*I probably shouldn't have shared this*",
